+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is "HTTPS everywhere, no exceptions": internal hosts get no carve-out, so plain HTTP is not permitted for them and all connections, internal ones included, must use HTTPS. This is consistent with the separate recorded decision that certificate verification stays on for all builds.
